  "author": "Akincibor",
  "severity": "HIGH",
  "description": "WordPress WPify Woo Czech plugin before 3.5.7 contains a cross-site scripting vulnerability. The plugin uses the Vies library 2.2.0, which has a sample file outputting $_SERVER[\u0027PHP_SELF\u0027] in an attribute without being escaped first. The issue is only exploitable when the web server has the PDO driver installed and write access to the example directory.",
